  "diagnosis": "Client-side Link navigation does not fire beforeunload. Nine Review forms registered native beforeunload only, so dirty changes-required notes could be lost on same-origin SPA links without a confirmation. The staged helper gives one document-level capture listener shared by all registered forms; cancellation prevents default and stops propagation before route/focus handlers. Each form registers only while its original native warning condition is active; every original warning remains installed.",
